---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navigation from "../../components/Navigation.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import { currentChapter } from "../../data/currentChapter";
import { withBase } from "../../utils/paths";
const { venture, education } = currentChapter;
---
<BaseLayout title="Adren.ai / AdrenLabs — Caleb Perez’s Product & AI Work" description="Caleb Perez’s work with the AdrenLabs founding team: developing Adren.ai through product definition, agent workflows, technical prototyping and research while studying AI at TETR.">
  <Navigation />
  <article class="px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20 lg:px-10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <a href={withBase("/#proyectos")} class="link-cta text-sm">← Back to ventures & projects</a>
      <header class="mt-9 max-w-4xl">
        <p class="eyebrow">Current venture · {venture.period}</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-6xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white sm:text-8xl">Adren.ai<span class="mt-3 block text-2xl font-medium tracking-normal text-cyan-200 sm:text-3xl">Building with AdrenLabs.</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-7 text-xl leading-9 text-slate-200">{venture.summary}</p>
        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href={venture.productUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary px-5 py-3 text-sm">Visit Adren.ai ↗</a><a href={venture.companyUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary px-5 py-3 text-sm">Visit AdrenLabs ↗</a></div>
      </header>
      <dl class="mt-10 grid gap-5 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div><dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">My role</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-white">{venture.role}</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">Team</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-white">Three-person team</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">Status</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-white">{venture.status}</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">Academic context</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-white">TETR · First semester in India</dd></div>
      </dl>

      <section class="mt-16 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.65fr_1.35fr]" aria-labelledby="context-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Context</p><h2 id="context-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Understand before automating.</h2></div>
        <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300"><p>Business problems often sit between conversations, disconnected tools and informal processes. The starting point for Adren.ai is to understand that context before deciding what software should do.</p><p>AdrenLabs is the venture we are building; Adren.ai is the product I am developing with the team. The direction connects AI-assisted discovery and operational diagnosis with concrete product requirements, prototypes and implementation priorities.</p><p>This page describes my contribution and our development direction. It does not present a finished deployment, customer traction or independently verified business results.</p></div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-16" aria-labelledby="contribution-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / My contribution</p><h2 id="contribution-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Where I spend my time.</h2><div class="mt-7 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">{venture.contributions.map((item) => <article class="surface-soft p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-cyan-100">{item.title}</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">{item.detail}</p></article>)}</div></section>

      <section class="mt-16" aria-labelledby="workflow-heading"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Product thinking</p><h2 id="workflow-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-white">A direction we can test.</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300">Conceptual workflow for the product, not a live demonstration or a claim that every stage is complete.</p><ol class="mt-7 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">{venture.workflow.map((step, index) => <li class="surface-inset p-6"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-300">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">{step.title}</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">{step.detail}</p></li>)}</ol></section>

      <section class="premium-card mt-16 p-6 sm:p-9" aria-labelledby="learning-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / Learning in practice</p><h2 id="learning-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-white">A venture alongside my AI degree.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">I am pursuing the {education.degree} at {education.institution}, {education.cohort}. Working on Adren.ai during my first semester in India lets me connect coursework with product choices, technical trade-offs and collaboration.</p><div class="mt-7 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-cyan-100">What I bring</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-300">Experience from Zalmar Travel, API integrations, self-hosted systems and AI-assisted development — combined with curiosity about how businesses operate.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-cyan-100">What comes next</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-300">Continue validating the problem, refine the prototype and document evidence as the work progresses. Future milestones will be added when they are achieved.</p></div></div></section>
      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-5 border-t border-white/10 pt-7"><a href={withBase("/#current-chapter")} class="link-cta text-sm">More about my current chapter</a><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated {currentChapter.updated}</p></div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
